OL,3,GNEWSAJames, Fatboy Slim and Amy
OL,4,AMacdonald to headline Belladrum 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames, Fatboy Slim and Amy Macdonald
OL,7,Fhave been announced as the headline
OL,8,Facts for next year's Belladrum Tartan
OL,9,FHeart festival.
OL,11,FManchester indie band James, who will
OL,12,Fhead up the event's Thursday line-up,
OL,13,Fwere forced to pull out of Bella's
OL,14,FSaturday night headline slot this year
OL,15,Fafter frontman Tim Booth lost his
OL,16,Fvoice.
OL,18,FFriday night act Fatboy Slim, aka DJ
OL,19,FNorman Cook, will be making his first
OL,20,FHighland festival appearance in 14
OL,21,Fyears having previously performed at
OL,22,FRockNess.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
