OL,3,GNEWSAJames, Fatboy Slim and Amy
OL,4,AMacdonald to headline Belladrum 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish singer-songwriter Amy
OL,7,FMacdonald will headline on Saturday 20
OL,8,Fyears after she first played at
OL,9,FBelladrum.
